# Jazzer fuzzing seed inputs and generated corpus are raw bytes.
# Mark them as binary so that git does not misinterpret the bytes as text,
# convert line terminators on checkout and thus change the fuzzing input.
# See https://github.com/CodeIntelligenceTesting/jazzer#directories-and-files
src/test/resources/**/fuzz/** binary
.cifuzz-corpus/** binary
# The fuzzing dictionary is text and should stay diffable.
src/test/resources/**/fuzz/*.dict text diff merge eol=lf
